 // current code, 1 the previous one (GS: drawing on the EE thread with the reference rasterizer), 2 the GS without its
-// band workers (everything rasterized on the GS thread), 3 the VU1 interpreter without blocks (ps2_vu1_blocks.h). A
+// band workers (everything rasterized on the GS thread), 3 the VU1 interpreter without blocks (ps2_vu1_blocks.h), 4 the
+// IOP advanced on every EE checkpoint instead of in batches (EeScheduler::accountCycles). A
